'''Continuation Stages''', also known as '''EX Stages''', are a type of stage introduced in the [[Version 5.0 Update]]. When clearing certain [[Legend Stages]], there is a chance that a Continuation Stage will be available to play with no extra [[Cat Energy|energy]] cost. The player cannot change their line-up when going into a Continuation Stage, and [[Battle Items]] (except Speed Ups) will not carry over.

