==Notes==
*Continuation Stages do not count towards map completion, meaning they don't have to be beaten to receive the [[Cat Food]] and [[Cat Energy|Leadership]] earned for clearing a map.
**Because of this, if you close the app in a Continuation Stage and then reopen the app, you will not get to start the level again, similar to a [[No Continues]] stage.
***Unlike No Continues stages, you may still use [[Cat Food]] (or watch an ad if available) to continue after losing the battle, unless that stage is also a No Continues stage.

